# {name}

An Ipê library scaffolded by `ipe init --lib`. `src/{module}.ipe` holds the
library's public surface; `package.ipe`'s `exposedModules` names the modules a
downstream consumer may import.

Build it:

```sh
ipe dev build
```

Add more public modules under `src/` and list each in both the module's own
`exposing (…)` clause and `package.ipe`'s `exposedModules`.
